---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../data/site-config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Kit-Bin"
  description="What happens to the files you process on Kit-Bin, what data is and isn't collected, and what will change before any advertising is enabled."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-6 text-ink dark:text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-slate-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Your files</h2>
      <p>
        Every tool on this site currently processes files entirely in your browser, using
        WebAssembly and native browser APIs. Your file is read into your browser's memory, the
        conversion runs on your device, and the result downloads directly to your device. At no
        point is a file you select uploaded to any server. This applies to every tool currently
        live on the site. None of them use a server fallback. If that changes for a specific
        tool in the future (for very large files or a format that genuinely can't be processed
        client-side), that tool's own page will say so explicitly.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Accounts and storage</h2>
      <p>
        There are no user accounts on this site. Files you select or process are not uploaded to
        or stored on Kit-Bin servers, and Kit-Bin does not maintain a database of user files.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not currently run any analytics or tracking script. If aggregate,
        cookieless usage analytics (page views, general device/location category, not
        individual tracking) are added in the future, this section will be updated to say so
        before that happens.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        No advertising is currently running on this site, and no advertising or ad-personalization
        cookies are being set. Kit-Bin may display advertising in the future to help cover hosting
        and development costs.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        This policy will be updated before advertising or any related tracking technology is
        activated. At that point it will name the advertising provider, state whether personalized
        or non-personalized ads are used, describe the cookie categories involved, explain how to
        change your consent, and link to the provider's own data-use information. Visitors in the
        UK, EEA, and Switzerland will be asked for consent through a certified consent-management
        platform before any personalized advertising is served.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
